    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d96">

                <pb facs="0503" n="383" xml:id="pg383"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A4a/88</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Under Secretary of State</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Phillips</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-08-24"><hi rendition="#italic">August 24,
                        1922</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Chilton of the British Embassy informed me that the ratifications of the
                    Washington treaties have been received from London. He wished to inquire whether
                    we were prepared to exchange ratifications. I told him that in my opinion the
                    ratifications ought to be held in the British Embassy until the appointed time
                    for the joint deposit of ratifications at the Department.</p>
                <closer><signed>W[<hi rendition="#small-caps">illiam</hi>] P[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">hillips</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
